OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening. However, it
OL,7,Fwill be turning increasingly cloudy
OL,8,Ffrom the northwest, which will bring
OL,9,Fsome patchy light rain at times
OL,10,Fovernight. Breezy and mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain moving southeastwards across all
OL,14,Fparts during the morning, which should
OL,15,Fclear the Kent coast by midday.
OL,16,FLargely dry with sunny spells in the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
